  (text "PR #6 — Z1 PRODUCTION BASELINE\nFuente de verdad eléctrica: hardware/z1_production_netlist.json\nContrato de sensores: hardware/sensor_interface_contract.json\nContrato UNO Q: hardware/insight_pin_contract.json"
