  (text "TEMP / A2-D16\nJ_TEMP → TEMP_1WIRE; D_TEMP PESD3V3U1UL a GND; R_TEMP_PU 4.7k poblado a 3V3_RAIL.\nSensor KIT0021 / DS18B20 digital 1-Wire."
